<p>You smack your forehead against your enemy's head (or whatever sensitive part you can find), causing <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>Strength 100,<br>Dexterity 100">51, 55, 58, 60, 63</acronym> Physical damage.</p><p>If the attack hits, the target is confused (<acronym class="stat-variable" title="Values for<br>Strength 10, 25, 50, 75, 100,<br>Dexterity 10, 25, 50, 75, 100">25%, 32%, 38%, 42%, 44%</acronym> effect) for <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">4, 4, 5, 5, 6</acronym> turns.</p><p>Damage done increases with the quality of your headgear, your Strength, and your physical damage bonuses.</p><p>Confusion power increases with your Dexterity, and chance increases with Accuracy.</p>